{
  "name": "Weekly cash-flow snapshot email from a sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "38871147-51bb-59c3-9351-5c02932df5b1",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"sheet_url\": \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit\",\n    \"sheet_tab\": \"Cash\",\n    \"owner_email\": \"you@example.com\",\n    \"business_name\": \"Your Business\",\n    \"sender_name\": \"Your Name\"\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ee88e680-4a55-5a6a-8288-262c03d89790",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "55af0ef0-ffbe-5845-8219-a4c525213ad3",
      "name": "Read rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Settings').first().json.config;\nconst rows = $input.all().map((i) => i.json).filter((r) => (true)).slice(0, 150);\nconst text = rows.map((r) => Object.entries(r).filter(([k]) => k !== 'row_number').map(([k, v]) => k + ': ' + v).join(' | ')).join('\\n');\nreturn [{ json: { count: rows.length, rows_text: text || 'No rows.' } }];"
      },
      "id": "c26fecbd-a0fb-5fa5-a5df-2b1161b1c771",
      "name": "Prepare the rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a friendly bookkeeper. From these rows (type is income or expense), give money in, money out and the net for the last 7 days, list anything due in the next 14 days, and flag one thing to watch.\n\nNumber of rows: {{ $json.count }}\nRows:\n{{ $json.rows_text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "e8c064ac-67c3-55b3-8550-fe672c7892a2",
      "name": "AI: write the summary",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-5-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-5-mini"
        },
        "responsesApiEnabled": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4d1e4c25-59c2-55c2-887e-5d933a175af7",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        960,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"headline\": \"Short subject line\",\n  \"summary\": \"Two or three sentences.\",\n  \"actions\": \"- First action\\n- Second action\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "65884063-102f-51ad-aa62-5a8a4b5ed66e",
      "name": "AI output format",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1160,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.owner_email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.output.headline }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.output.summary }}\n\nWhat to do next:\n{{ $json.output.actions }}\n\n(Based on {{ $('Prepare the rows').first().json.count }} rows from your sheet.)",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "219ff767-c837-5cd7-867e-2326f62bceee",
      "name": "Email the summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly cash-flow snapshot email from a sheet\nEvery Monday reads your income and expense sheet and emails a plain-English snapshot of money in, money out and what is due soon.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "bedc7c7a-e730-5931-88ac-8cbeeda56cbd",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Cash** and these headers in row 1 (see `sheet-headers.csv`).\n2. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and the email that should receive the summary.\n3. Connect Google Sheets, Gmail and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n4. Run once by hand to see the email, then switch the workflow to **Active** (it runs on the schedule in the first node).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "7ca2711a-b2df-5a2a-be59-0e6d3a028abf",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -400
      ]
    }
